  "NEVER routes, coordinates or step lists here (L1's rule; W6 gates campaign.json for x, y, route, path, steps, coords).",
  "Field-move and key-item needs whose basis is not a decomp line are UNVERIFIED until the chapter packs' adversarial pass (W7, the next slice)."
